{
	quest.06CA7CC483D0C8F4.quest_desc: [
		"Lt. Surge waits in the &eVermilion Gym&r."
		"Type &a/gymmap&r for directions to the nearest one, with a map."
		"You can also challenge Lt. Surge in Vermilion's gym in the Kanto cities: talk to them there."
		""
		"Your whole party must be at or under your level cap to battle."
